#: .\dashboard\compliance_catalog.py:10
msgid "Plan de transition biodiversité"
msgstr "Biodiversity transition plan"

#: .\dashboard\compliance_catalog.py:12
msgid ""
"À publier uniquement si un plan de transition existe ou a été rendu public. S'il existe, décrire "
"l'alignement avec le Cadre mondial Kunming-Montréal (stopper et inverser la perte de biodiversité "
"d'ici 2030). Sinon, simple déclaration d'absence."
msgstr ""
"Disclose only if a transition plan exists or has been made public. If it exists, describe its "
"alignment with the Kunming-Montreal Global Biodiversity Framework (halt and reverse biodiversity "
"loss by 2030). Otherwise, a simple statement that there is none."

#: .\dashboard\compliance_catalog.py:20 .\dashboard\templates\dashboard\index.html:102
#: .\dashboard\templates\dashboard\index.html:104
msgid "Politiques"
msgstr "Policies"

#: .\dashboard\compliance_catalog.py:22
msgid ""
"Politiques biodiversité couvrant la traçabilité des produits/matières à impact matériel et les "
"sites proches de zones sensibles. Test clé : la politique couvre-t-elle les impacts matériels "
"identifiés dans la DMA ?"
msgstr ""
"Biodiversity policies covering the traceability of products/materials with material impacts and "
"sites near sensitive areas. Key test: does the policy cover the material impacts identified in the"
" DMA?"

#: .\dashboard\compliance_catalog.py:29
msgid "Actions et ressources"
msgstr "Actions and resources"

#: .\dashboard\compliance_catalog.py:31
msgid ""
"Actions et moyens engagés. Focus sur les compensations (offsets) et leur place dans la hiérarchie "
"d'atténuation (éviter → réduire → restaurer → compenser). Seules les actions engagées/financées "
"comptent."
msgstr ""
"Actions taken and resources committed. Focus on offsets and their place in the mitigation "
"hierarchy (avoid → reduce → restore → offset). Only committed/funded actions count."

#: .\dashboard\compliance_catalog.py:38
msgid "Cibles"
msgstr "Targets"

#: .\dashboard\compliance_catalog.py:40
msgid ""
"Cibles biodiversité : seuils écologiques et méthodo, alignement Kunming-Montréal / Stratégie UE "
"Biodiversité 2030, usage d'offsets, portée géographique, niveau de la hiérarchie d'atténuation "
"visé."
msgstr ""
"Biodiversity targets: ecological thresholds and methodology, alignment with Kunming-Montreal / EU "
"Biodiversity Strategy 2030, use of offsets, geographic scope, targeted level of the mitigation "
"hierarchy."

#: .\dashboard\compliance_catalog.py:47
msgid "Métriques d'impact"
msgstr "Impact metrics"

#: .\dashboard\compliance_catalog.py:49
msgid ""
"Métrique dure : nombre et surface (hectares) des sites situés dans/près de zones sensibles avec "
"impacts négatifs (analyse géospatiale). Métriques additionnelles optionnelles : étendue/condition "
"des écosystèmes, indicateurs d'espèces (IUCN/European Red List), connectivité des habitats."
msgstr ""
"Core metric: number and area (hectares) of sites located in/near sensitive areas with negative "
"impacts (geospatial analysis). Optional additional metrics: ecosystem extent/condition, species "
"indicators (IUCN/European Red List), habitat connectivity."

#: .\dashboard\compliance_catalog.py:57
msgid "Effets financiers anticipés"
msgstr "Anticipated financial effects"

#: .\dashboard\compliance_catalog.py:59
msgid ""
"Effets financiers anticipés des risques et opportunités biodiversité. Supprimé dans la version "
"amendée (déc. 2025) — présent uniquement en mode ESRS E4 original 2023."
msgstr ""
"Anticipated financial effects of biodiversity risks and opportunities. Removed in the amended "
"version (Dec. 2025) — only present in original ESRS E4 2023 mode."

