"generated). Scarcity: latest-year production × regionalised ReCiPe 2016 \"fossil\" and \"mineral "
"resource scarcity\" factors. Assets counted at 100 %%, not weighted by ownership share. "
"Consumption reported at group level is not broken down by asset and is shown separately."

